                                "sense_id": "ed7b91b7-1a8f-31d2-a805-15e9c56817bd",
                                "text": "It’s a wildly dated-looking and derivative film, a quaint adventure in fantasised naughtiness, like Ozon’s teen prostitute fantasy Jeune et Jolie in 2013, which starred his lead actress here, Marine Vacth, in a similarly gamine role."
